---
import SectionLabel from "./SectionLabel.astro";
---

<section class="section" id="problem">
  <div class="shell" data-reveal>
    <SectionLabel label="The Problem" />
    <h2>The software gap that slows businesses down.</h2>
    <div class="copy-grid">
      <p>
        Many businesses do not need a huge engineering department. They need a practical
        software partner who can turn unclear ideas, broken workflows, and unfinished
        products into tools that actually work.
      </p>
      <p>
        The risk is not just bad code. It is unclear scope, silent weeks, missed launches,
        messy handoff, and software nobody can maintain after the developer leaves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
